      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Renekton's attacks generate Fury, increased when he is low on life. This Fury can empower his abilities with bonus effects.",
      "summary_zh": "雷克顿的攻击会产生【怒气】，在它的生命值较低时产生更多【怒气】。【怒气】可以强化他的基础技能，使它们具有额外效果。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
