      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Renekton swings his blade, dealing moderate physical damage to all targets around him, and heals for a small portion of the damage dealt. If he has more than 50 Fury, his damage and heal are increased.",
      "summary_zh": "雷克顿挥动他的武器，对周围所有目标造成中等水平物理伤害，并根据造成的伤害来治疗自己。如果他有50点以上怒气，那么此技能的伤害和治疗效果会得到提升。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1309205:4008014"
      ]
    },
    {
