      ],
      "summary_en": "Renekton slashes his target twice, dealing moderate physical damage and stuns them for 0.75 seconds. If Renekton has more than 50 Fury, he slashes his target three times, destroying damage shields on the target, dealing high physical damage, and stunning them for 1.5 seconds.",
      "summary_zh": "雷克顿两次挥击目标，对其造成中等水平物理伤害并晕眩其0.75秒。如果雷克顿有50点以上怒气，他会三次挥击目标，摧毁目标身上的伤害护盾，对其造成高额物理伤害，并晕眩其1.5秒。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
